WEBVTT

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:20.145
My shoulders are so sore...

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:25.234
April is already really busy. I can't
believe we have to do a birthday party, too.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:27.319
This is part of our job, too.

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:36.036
"Happy April Birthdays!"

00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:47.923
Okay, everyone smile!

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:50.676
Smile!

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:55.389
I just want to be left alone so I can read.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:01.645
Birthday, huh?

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:14.491
"From: Tsugumi Shirasaki"
"Definitely a maid for me!"

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:20.956
Then I'm going to work hard to make
you want to work together after that, too.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.793
"April 26"

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:27.379
I'll have to give her an answer soon.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:41.518
<i>Writing down my aspirations</i>

00:01:41.518 --> 00:01:44.271
<i>For the day when they will come true</i>

00:01:44.271 --> 00:01:49.610
<i>The time has come when</i>
<i>I want to turn to the page I marked</i>

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:55.073
<i>Although there are things I lose</i>
<i>sight of with everything that happens</i>

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:56.450
<i>Hey, it's all right</i>

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>The start I'm embarking on is unexpected</i>

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.207
<i>The memory that you couldn't erase</i>

00:02:03.207 --> 00:02:05.876
<i>Even that sad memory</i>

00:02:05.876 --> 00:02:09.922
<i>I'll give it a different, happier reading</i>

00:02:09.922 --> 00:02:15.552
<i>I feel like just that will change everything</i>

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:16.678
<i>All Right</i>

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:19.890
<i>So come now, the way you are!</i>

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:22.726
<i>Don't hide your weak self</i>

00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:23.727
<i>On my Sheep </i>

00:02:23.727 --> 00:02:27.397
<i>Let's meet riding on a dream</i>

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:33.362
<i>Even just calling your name as</i>
<i>I write in this book of adventures</i>

00:02:33.362 --> 00:02:36.156
<i>I'm not lost anymore</i>

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:39.868
<i>Let's start our journey together</i>

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:47.626
<i>Yes... more of you and me!</i>

00:02:57.636 --> 00:02:59.304
"Episode 4: A New Library Club"
I see.

00:02:59.304 --> 00:03:04.893
"Episode 4: A New Library Club"
There was no one living at that address, huh?

00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:07.396
At this rate, we're out of options.

00:03:07.396 --> 00:03:09.982
If only we had another lead...

00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:17.447
The job was to find information
about the person who sent the email.

00:03:17.447 --> 00:03:20.659
You can't expect me to
keep helping you beyond that!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:22.870
You're right.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:26.164
I did what I was supposed to do.

00:03:26.164 --> 00:03:30.043
I will have your payment as promised.

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:31.795
Uh, right...

00:03:32.838 --> 00:03:37.801
Here's information on
Cafeteria Appllio's S-Spring Fair.

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:41.847
We're currently passing out
samples from the special menu.

00:03:41.847 --> 00:03:47.477
--Customers who bring this flyer will get 10% off.
--Please take one!

00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:48.812
Thank you.

00:03:48.812 --> 00:03:50.439
Oh, thanks!

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:57.070
Hello. It looks like you all are working hard.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.198
Mochizuki! Here, have one.

00:03:59.198 --> 00:04:01.158
Oh, thanks.

00:04:02.451 --> 00:04:05.704
President, are you looking for someone?

00:04:05.704 --> 00:04:08.707
N-No, not in particular...

00:04:08.707 --> 00:04:10.209
You're cute!

00:04:10.209 --> 00:04:11.960
Let me have a flyer!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.504
Me, too!

00:04:17.049 --> 00:04:18.509
I haven't seen her before.

00:04:18.509 --> 00:04:22.679
She's new. Please, treat her well.

00:04:22.679 --> 00:04:23.847
Huh?

00:04:23.847 --> 00:04:26.975
Would you like a sample of our new menu?

00:04:26.975 --> 00:04:28.560
What department are you from?

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.354
What year are you? What's your name?

00:04:30.354 --> 00:04:32.231
Um... Please stop...

00:04:32.231 --> 00:04:35.651
Okay, okay. It's time for Kyoko to freshen up.

00:04:35.651 --> 00:04:37.152
What?

00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:43.367
I can't do this anymore.

00:04:43.367 --> 00:04:45.827
Kyoko's really popular.

00:04:45.827 --> 00:04:47.829
I was completely set up...

00:04:47.829 --> 00:04:49.790
I'm really sorry!

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:54.169
I was trying to make a butler outfit,
but somehow, it turned into a maid outfit...

00:04:54.169 --> 00:04:56.463
How did <i>that </i>happen?

00:04:56.463 --> 00:04:59.466
It can't be helped. Everyone makes mistakes.

00:04:59.466 --> 00:05:02.344
They definitely had a hand in this.

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:06.723
Kakei, you look so cute!

00:05:06.723 --> 00:05:09.268
I want to put you on the
Suzuki world heritage list!

00:05:11.103 --> 00:05:13.355
Are you having fun in the Library Club, Suzuki?

00:05:13.355 --> 00:05:18.610
Yeah. It's fun being with everyone,
and putting makeup on Kyoko...

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:20.988
What about you, Kakei?

00:05:20.988 --> 00:05:26.493
Well, I think it'd be perfect
if I were 20 cm shorter...

00:05:26.493 --> 00:05:29.580
Sounds like you're having fun, too.

00:05:29.621 --> 00:05:31.915
Oh, can you close your eyes for a sec?

00:05:31.915 --> 00:05:33.542
Sure.

00:05:34.751 --> 00:05:39.131
Actually, I was kind of
betting on the Library Club...

00:05:39.131 --> 00:05:42.092
I thought maybe it'd be able
to change things somehow.

00:05:52.477 --> 00:05:56.607
Sorry, people might get the
wrong idea if we're seen like this.

00:05:56.607 --> 00:06:00.277
I might be okay with that...

00:06:00.277 --> 00:06:01.028
Huh?

00:06:01.028 --> 00:06:03.906
It'd be a problem if I said that, huh?

00:06:05.908 --> 00:06:07.910
"Shiomi Academy"
"Student Cafeteria - Appllio"

00:06:11.121 --> 00:06:13.165
Thank you.

00:06:13.165 --> 00:06:15.042
Shirasaki...

00:06:15.042 --> 00:06:17.377
Oh, Misono!

00:06:17.377 --> 00:06:18.879
Are you feeling better?

00:06:18.879 --> 00:06:19.838
Yes...

00:06:19.838 --> 00:06:22.466
Thank you very much
for your help while I was sick.

00:06:22.466 --> 00:06:24.301
Please, this is for everyone.

00:06:24.301 --> 00:06:25.886
Thanks!

00:06:25.886 --> 00:06:27.262
You're working hard.

00:06:27.262 --> 00:06:29.264
Is this for the Happy Project, as well?

00:06:29.264 --> 00:06:30.390
Yeah!

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:31.266
I know!

00:06:31.266 --> 00:06:32.935
Do you want to try, too, Misono?

00:06:32.935 --> 00:06:35.562
It's more fun than you'd expect
when you do it with everyone.

00:06:35.562 --> 00:06:38.440
Yes, it's only embarrassing at first.

00:06:39.107 --> 00:06:40.651
With everyone...?

00:06:40.651 --> 00:06:43.946
I'm scared of speaking in public,
so I can't do it very well,

00:06:43.946 --> 00:06:46.573
but you're used to being
in front of people, right?

00:06:46.573 --> 00:06:50.118
And if people find out the
Song Princess is passing out flyers,

00:06:50.118 --> 00:06:53.413
I think they'd all be surprised and happy!

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:56.166
It's because I'm the Song Princess, after all...

00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:57.918
Misono...?

00:06:57.918 --> 00:07:01.171
Did you take care of me while
I was sick because of that, too?

00:07:01.171 --> 00:07:04.341
--What? No--
--Excuse me!

00:07:08.345 --> 00:07:09.555
Misono?

00:07:09.555 --> 00:07:11.807
Kakei, what should I do?

00:07:18.522 --> 00:07:19.606
"A new world is waiting for you
after school. From the Shepherd."

00:07:19.606 --> 00:07:22.234
This was a lie...

00:07:23.151 --> 00:07:25.112
Please wait, Misono!

00:07:30.659 --> 00:07:32.953
Wh-What do you want?

00:07:32.953 --> 00:07:35.414
Huh? Oh...

00:07:38.166 --> 00:07:39.126
It's me.

00:07:39.126 --> 00:07:40.586
Kakei?!

00:07:40.586 --> 00:07:42.254
Do you like wearing girls' clothes?

00:07:42.254 --> 00:07:47.509
No, no, no. This is, you know,
'cause I had to pass out flyers...

00:07:47.509 --> 00:07:50.012
Well, what do you want?

00:07:50.012 --> 00:07:52.598
I don't want you to misunderstand Shirasaki.

00:07:52.598 --> 00:07:54.391
I'm not misunderstanding...

00:07:54.391 --> 00:07:57.936
Shirasaki took care of you
because she couldn't leave you alone.

00:07:57.936 --> 00:07:59.980
That's all it was.

00:08:01.899 --> 00:08:04.443
I want you to believe in her good intentions.

00:08:05.194 --> 00:08:06.904
What are "good intentions"?

00:08:06.904 --> 00:08:08.197
Huh?

00:08:08.197 --> 00:08:10.365
Do you believe in them?

00:08:10.365 --> 00:08:11.867
I...

00:08:15.704 --> 00:08:18.749
I didn't either, at first.

00:08:18.749 --> 00:08:22.252
I thought it was just hypocrisy.

00:08:22.252 --> 00:08:26.882
But I think Shirasaki is
different from people like that.

00:08:27.966 --> 00:08:30.636
It's never boring being around her.

00:08:30.636 --> 00:08:32.888
She's not normal, anyway.

00:08:35.265 --> 00:08:39.269
Your clothes are even more "not normal."

00:08:39.269 --> 00:08:42.856
Oh... that's true.

00:08:51.698 --> 00:08:53.325
Misono...

00:08:55.911 --> 00:08:59.998
I'm sorry! I was being insensitive.

00:08:59.998 --> 00:09:02.042
I'm really sorry!

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:07.047
No, I apologize as well.

00:09:08.173 --> 00:09:09.967
Misono...

00:09:11.385 --> 00:09:13.929
And so, Misono!

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:16.223
Hm?

00:09:18.058 --> 00:09:21.770
Th-Thanks for coming...

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:24.815
Look, look! The Song Princess
is passing out flyers!

00:09:24.815 --> 00:09:27.860
Oh, she is! But why is she wearing cat ears?

00:09:29.862 --> 00:09:31.780
I guess it can't be helped...

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:35.117
Cafeteria Appllio will be having a Spring Fair!

00:09:35.117 --> 00:09:37.953
Yay! All right!

00:09:40.289 --> 00:09:43.500
I'm so tired...

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:48.338
Misono, thanks for coming today.
It was really fun thanks to you.

00:09:48.338 --> 00:09:50.424
Yes, well...

00:09:50.424 --> 00:09:53.594
Hey, do you want to come to
the library after school tomorrow?

00:09:53.594 --> 00:09:55.095
Me?

00:09:55.095 --> 00:09:57.681
There's a cat with a strange personality...

00:09:57.681 --> 00:09:59.224
Cat?!

00:09:59.933 --> 00:10:02.686
Hey wait, can you call that a cat?

00:10:02.686 --> 00:10:05.772
What do you think Master Giza is, Kakei?

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:08.984
I'll think about it.

00:10:23.665 --> 00:10:25.334
Hello, hello!

00:10:27.085 --> 00:10:29.421
Hey, what's with that reaction?

00:10:29.421 --> 00:10:31.423
Come on, Kanasuke.

00:10:31.423 --> 00:10:34.384
Sorry, we thought you were Misono...

00:10:34.384 --> 00:10:37.930
"Kanasuke" is pretty good, though. I like it.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.849
All right. Then you're Kanasuke from now on!

00:10:40.849 --> 00:10:42.226
Kanasuke.

00:10:42.226 --> 00:10:43.602
Kanasuke.

00:10:43.602 --> 00:10:44.603
Kana!

00:10:44.603 --> 00:10:46.897
You're not going to go along with it, huh?

00:10:46.897 --> 00:10:50.984
Well, she can call her what
she wants. Right, Tama-Tama?

00:10:50.984 --> 00:10:52.819
It sounds like you really want to die.

00:10:54.196 --> 00:10:55.489
Huh?

00:10:58.242 --> 00:10:59.826
Misono!

00:10:59.826 --> 00:11:01.828
I came to see the cat.

00:11:01.828 --> 00:11:05.832
Right, right! Thanks for coming!

00:11:08.961 --> 00:11:12.297
Ta-da! And this is Master Giza.

00:11:15.133 --> 00:11:17.594
Stop it, Giza. You're scaring Misono--

00:11:17.594 --> 00:11:18.637
So cute...

00:11:18.637 --> 00:11:19.888
Huh?!

00:11:19.888 --> 00:11:22.224
Special... just for you...

00:11:22.724 --> 00:11:25.102
How unseemly, coming on strong like that!

00:11:25.102 --> 00:11:27.229
Please use this if you'd like!

00:11:27.229 --> 00:11:31.859
I embroidered it with a cat
and musical note with you in mind...

00:11:31.859 --> 00:11:36.071
I-It's not because you're
the Song Princess, though...

00:11:37.239 --> 00:11:41.535
O-Oh right, I used a special
blend of tea for you, Misono.

00:11:41.535 --> 00:11:43.453
It's good for the throat, so your voice will...

00:11:45.664 --> 00:11:47.624
--Tamamo...
--There, there.

00:11:47.624 --> 00:11:49.835
That's Shirasaki for you.

00:11:49.835 --> 00:11:54.089
It makes me feel foolish
for getting worked up about it.

00:11:54.089 --> 00:11:55.924
Be quiet!

00:11:55.924 --> 00:11:57.885
Sorry, Kodachi.

00:11:57.885 --> 00:11:59.887
Stop messing arou--

00:12:00.888 --> 00:12:03.265
What, you got <i>another </i>one?

00:12:03.265 --> 00:12:06.518
Now, now, I don't know
if this will make up for it,

00:12:06.518 --> 00:12:08.896
but let's all go here together.

00:12:08.896 --> 00:12:13.275
"Sunrise Bathhouse Coupon"
30% off... Why a bathhouse?

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:20.866
The hot water at Yayoi Dorm is broken?

00:12:20.866 --> 00:12:24.036
Yeah, there's no hot water
in any of the rooms...

00:12:24.036 --> 00:12:28.916
So last night, Yayoi Dorm was filled
with a girl's high-pitched screaming...

00:12:46.141 --> 00:12:49.728
But why do we all have to
go to the bathhouse together?

00:12:49.728 --> 00:12:53.190
It's a good chance for the Library Club
to get to know each other better!

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:56.109
So, who's your type, Kakei?

00:12:56.109 --> 00:12:57.694
Why are we talking about that?

00:12:57.694 --> 00:12:59.696
"Sunrise Bathhouse"

00:12:59.947 --> 00:13:02.991
Guilty! That's the verdict!

00:13:02.991 --> 00:13:06.078
Nagi Kodachi's chest deviates
from what is socially acceptable;

00:13:06.078 --> 00:13:07.579
therefore, she is guilty!

00:13:07.579 --> 00:13:08.872
Huh?

00:13:08.872 --> 00:13:11.875
No objections! No objections! No objections!

00:13:11.875 --> 00:13:15.462
Justice is empty... My heart is lonely...

00:13:15.462 --> 00:13:17.798
Then that's a crime, too, isn't it?

00:13:17.798 --> 00:13:19.591
What? Me?

00:13:19.591 --> 00:13:23.178
Shirasaki got close to guilty
and turned around to be innocent.

00:13:23.178 --> 00:13:26.640
Don't cry, Suzuki. In the end,
they're just lumps of fat.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:31.228
Kana, you drink milk and
eat meat every day, so you'll be fine.

00:13:31.228 --> 00:13:34.481
I think your words are
having the opposite effect...

00:13:34.481 --> 00:13:37.985
Misono! I'm glad we're the same!

00:13:37.985 --> 00:13:39.653
We're not the same...

00:13:39.653 --> 00:13:42.531
Aw, we're both first years, so let's be friends.

00:13:42.531 --> 00:13:45.701
Shirasaki, did yours get bigger?

00:13:45.701 --> 00:13:48.287
Tamamo, stop it!

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:53.000
I should've brought a book for the bath.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.085
To keep control of your reason?

00:13:55.085 --> 00:13:56.378
Don't say stupid things!

00:13:57.379 --> 00:13:59.548
S-Sorry...!

00:13:59.548 --> 00:14:01.466
As long as you understand.

00:14:04.636 --> 00:14:07.472
It's almost Golden Week, isn't it?

00:14:07.472 --> 00:14:08.932
Yeah.

00:14:08.932 --> 00:14:12.477
Have you decided what to
do about the Happy Project?

00:14:12.477 --> 00:14:14.897
Yeah.

00:14:14.897 --> 00:14:16.440
I see.

00:14:17.065 --> 00:14:19.276
By the way...

00:14:19.276 --> 00:14:22.362
Kodachi, you seem to
be very friendly with Kakei.

00:14:22.362 --> 00:14:24.364
Y-Yeah, that's true.

00:14:24.364 --> 00:14:28.410
Oh? Curious about Kakei?

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:30.579
It's not like that.

00:14:31.788 --> 00:14:33.582
Oh my, what's this?

00:14:33.582 --> 00:14:37.878
But it's like Kakei's dating his books.

00:14:37.878 --> 00:14:40.172
His room is filled with them.

00:14:40.172 --> 00:14:42.549
You've been to Kakei's room?

00:14:42.549 --> 00:14:47.804
Oh, Kakei didn't tell you about us?

00:14:47.804 --> 00:14:50.891
D-Don't tell me you're already...?

00:14:50.891 --> 00:14:52.226
Scandalous.

00:14:52.226 --> 00:14:56.104
Oh dear, our rooms just are next to each other.

00:14:56.104 --> 00:14:57.856
That's all?

00:14:58.899 --> 00:15:00.359
What?

00:15:00.359 --> 00:15:02.653
"Please keep valuables in a locker"
He said I could go over whenever I wanted,

00:15:02.653 --> 00:15:05.656
but even when I do, all we
do is watch late night dramas.

00:15:05.656 --> 00:15:08.158
Well, I'm going out first.

00:15:11.787 --> 00:15:13.330
"Whenever"...

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.582
Spending late nights together...

00:15:15.582 --> 00:15:17.584
Kakei is... Guilty!

00:15:17.584 --> 00:15:20.087
"Women's Bath"
Kakei is... Guilty!

00:15:20.379 --> 00:15:24.341
At this rate, Kakei will get
together with someone soon...

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:28.136
I feel uneasy...

00:15:29.555 --> 00:15:31.473
What's this feeling?

00:15:34.768 --> 00:15:37.896
How nice. Girls right out of the bath.

00:15:40.607 --> 00:15:43.443
Let's do this again, Takamine!

00:15:43.443 --> 00:15:46.572
Kakei seems to have more fun at home, though.

00:15:46.572 --> 00:15:48.115
Huh?

00:15:50.701 --> 00:15:52.327
Kakei.

00:15:52.327 --> 00:15:54.538
Can we talk?

00:15:54.538 --> 00:15:56.582
S-Sure...

00:16:00.127 --> 00:16:01.170
Here.

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.380
Oh, thanks.

00:16:04.798 --> 00:16:07.217
Wh-What did you want to talk about?

00:16:07.217 --> 00:16:12.347
Um, would it be all right to
hear your answer tomorrow?

00:16:12.347 --> 00:16:14.766
Oh, so that's what it was.

00:16:15.392 --> 00:16:18.687
There's something I have to tell you...

00:16:18.687 --> 00:16:22.107
Remember how you asked me
about why I wanted to change myself?

00:16:22.107 --> 00:16:24.276
I didn't tell you yet, did I?

00:16:24.276 --> 00:16:26.069
No...

00:16:26.445 --> 00:16:31.074
I have a sister named Sayori
who's two years younger than me,

00:16:31.074 --> 00:16:34.036
but she's been sick in
the hospital for a long time.

00:16:34.036 --> 00:16:38.207
I don't think I can go to Shiomi Academy...

00:16:38.207 --> 00:16:42.961
That's not true. You'll get better soon,
and we can go to school together.

00:16:42.961 --> 00:16:45.047
What kind of place is Shiomi Academy?

00:16:45.047 --> 00:16:47.257
Huh... Uh, well--

00:16:47.257 --> 00:16:49.968
It's a really nice place.

00:16:49.968 --> 00:16:51.929
Every day is really fun...

00:16:51.929 --> 00:16:56.391
I have a lot of friends, too!
I can't wait to introduce them to you.

00:16:56.391 --> 00:17:01.855
We even had a club activity to get
to know each other better, so we all...

00:17:01.855 --> 00:17:04.149
I lied at the spur of the moment.

00:17:04.149 --> 00:17:07.528
I thought, if that would make
Sayori feel even a little better...

00:17:07.528 --> 00:17:10.656
And then the lies kept piling on.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:15.285
I'm sure she'd be disappointed
if she knew the truth,

00:17:15.285 --> 00:17:17.871
so I had no choice but to keep lying...

00:17:17.871 --> 00:17:20.541
I hated myself for it.

00:17:22.793 --> 00:17:25.420
I'm really a terrible person.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:27.297
You're appalled, aren't you?

00:17:30.551 --> 00:17:35.180
What? I'm so terrible
you're laughing? I knew it!

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:37.850
No, that's not it.

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:44.481
You wanted to make those lies true
by the time your sister came, right?

00:17:44.481 --> 00:17:46.900
Huh? Um, yeah...

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:49.111
You're a good girl, Shirasaki.

00:17:49.111 --> 00:17:51.738
You're doing things
to make it happen, aren't you?

00:17:51.738 --> 00:17:53.991
What? Not at all!

00:17:53.991 --> 00:17:57.286
Even now, I couldn't do
anything without everyone's help.

00:17:57.286 --> 00:18:01.748
Everyone wants to help
because you're working hard.

00:18:01.748 --> 00:18:03.417
Have confidence in yourself.

00:18:03.417 --> 00:18:05.252
Kakei...

00:18:05.252 --> 00:18:07.421
Thanks.

00:18:07.421 --> 00:18:09.840
Is that all you wanted to say?

00:18:09.840 --> 00:18:10.757
Yeah.

00:18:10.757 --> 00:18:13.927
See you tomorrow, then, at the Library Club.

00:18:13.927 --> 00:18:19.766
No matter what answer you give, I'll accept it.

00:18:19.766 --> 00:18:23.312
Okay. I'll give you a straight answer.

00:18:25.063 --> 00:18:27.733
Through the activities of the Library Club,

00:18:27.733 --> 00:18:31.987
I was able to get to know
someone named Shirasaki.

00:18:32.863 --> 00:18:36.825
These past few days weren't too bad.

00:18:39.161 --> 00:18:42.372
But it's been enough.

00:18:47.002 --> 00:18:49.505
Happy birthday!

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:52.466
--Happy birthday!
--Happy birthday!

00:18:52.466 --> 00:18:54.259
"Happy birthday, Kakei!"

00:18:54.259 --> 00:18:56.011
"Kakei"

00:18:56.178 --> 00:18:57.221
Huh?

00:18:57.221 --> 00:18:59.681
Now, now. This way--

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.394
You did this for me?

00:19:04.394 --> 00:19:06.230
Was it your idea, Shirasaki?

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:09.399
No, we thought of it together.

00:19:09.399 --> 00:19:11.485
Takamine's the one who remembered.

00:19:11.485 --> 00:19:15.614
When we met, we showed each
other our student IDs, remember?

00:19:15.614 --> 00:19:17.115
A huge success!

00:19:17.115 --> 00:19:21.161
Kakei, you have a stupid look of
amazement on your face right now.

00:19:22.996 --> 00:19:25.207
Wh-What's this feeling?

00:19:25.207 --> 00:19:26.875
--Ready, go!
--Three, four!

00:19:34.049 --> 00:19:35.467
I...

00:19:39.346 --> 00:19:42.641
What do I want to do?

00:19:45.686 --> 00:19:47.646
I don't know.

00:19:54.528 --> 00:19:57.239
This is the future of the Library Club?

00:19:57.239 --> 00:20:01.368
"Kakei"

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:02.369
"Happy birthday, Kakei!"

00:20:02.369 --> 00:20:05.205
--Happy birthday!
--Happy birthday!

00:20:05.205 --> 00:20:09.001
So this is Shirasaki's Happy Project, huh?

00:20:14.548 --> 00:20:16.216
Yay! Whoo!

00:20:16.925 --> 00:20:20.220
Kakei! How do you feel right now?

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:23.765
R-Right... Thank you so much for today.

00:20:23.765 --> 00:20:29.062
It was unexpected, and I'm surprised, but I...

00:20:29.062 --> 00:20:30.564
Hm?

00:20:30.564 --> 00:20:32.649
I...

00:20:33.775 --> 00:20:40.657
That's right. I want to
know what this feeling is.

00:20:40.657 --> 00:20:43.493
We got new members and everything.

00:20:43.493 --> 00:20:45.996
I'm counting on everyone
once Golden Week starts, too.

00:20:50.334 --> 00:20:52.127
Kakei...

00:20:52.127 --> 00:20:54.421
Thank you very much!

00:20:54.421 --> 00:20:58.509
Kakei, thank you!

00:20:59.259 --> 00:21:02.679
It was the first time anyone had
celebrated my birthday from the heart.

00:21:04.681 --> 00:21:09.436
I never imagined a day like that would come.

00:21:09.436 --> 00:21:16.610
I was confused by a feeling
that wasn't happiness or fun,

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:19.863
but something completely different.

00:21:19.863 --> 00:21:23.116
"To: The Shepherd"
"What do I have to do to meet you?"

00:21:23.116 --> 00:21:23.408
"Message sent"

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:30.916
Shepherd, nothing escapes you, does it?

00:21:31.583 --> 00:21:38.340
<i>The starting bell, the sound of a lock</i>

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:39.341
<i>The starting bell, the sound of a lock</i>
"I wish you good luck on your new endeavor."

00:21:39.341 --> 00:21:40.342
<i>The starting bell, the sound of a lock</i>
"When you figure out who I am,"

00:21:40.342 --> 00:21:41.343
<i>While drifting aimlessly, I become an adult</i>
"please come talk to me."

00:21:41.343 --> 00:21:48.016
<i>While drifting aimlessly, I become an adult</i>

00:21:48.016 --> 00:21:57.860
<i>The time has come when days spent</i>
<i>running and playing seem far away</i>

00:21:57.860 --> 00:22:02.114
<i>The answer I gave here</i>

00:22:02.114 --> 00:22:15.043
<i>Oh, if only it had been</i>
<i>passed down somewhere</i>

00:22:15.043 --> 00:22:19.840
<i>For those crowds walking around lost</i>

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:24.219
<i>It can be a light that shines on them</i>

00:22:24.219 --> 00:22:28.557
<i>From the morning sun climbing the trembling sky</i>

00:22:28.557 --> 00:22:32.978
<i>To the first star of the night</i>

00:22:32.978 --> 00:22:37.608
<i>When you look back, it's a nostalgic scene</i>

00:22:37.608 --> 00:22:41.778
<i>Next to me, you are facing forward</i>

00:22:41.778 --> 00:22:50.120
<i>On the other side of the</i>
<i>green belt that surrounds us</i>

00:22:50.120 --> 00:22:58.504
<i>You head toward endless tomorrows</i>

00:23:11.016 --> 00:23:13.519
Master Giza, please play with me today.

00:23:13.519 --> 00:23:14.770
No problem.

00:23:14.770 --> 00:23:16.605
First, this--

00:23:16.605 --> 00:23:17.397
Ok.

00:23:17.397 --> 00:23:20.651
Coochie-coochie-coochie-coo...

00:23:22.653 --> 00:23:24.196
Unseemly.

00:23:24.196 --> 00:23:25.447
Do you want more?

00:23:25.447 --> 00:23:27.199
Please.

00:23:27.699 --> 00:23:29.535
Master Misono's words are...?

00:23:29.535 --> 00:23:30.661
The law...

00:23:30.661 --> 00:23:32.788
"Next time: The Truth Behind the Messages"

00:23:32.788 --> 00:23:37.125
"Next time: The Truth Behind the Messages"
Discipline?!
